---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
warning[shift_overflow]: shifting a `s32` by 40 shifts out all 32 of its bits
  --> tests/lint/shift_overflow/bad.jai:4:10
   |
 4 |     a := x << 40;
   |          ^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: the shift count must be below 32; widen the value first, `(cast(u64) x) << 40`, if more bits are needed
   = note: `shift_overflow` is `warn` by default

warning[shift_overflow]: shifting a `s32` by 32 shifts out all 32 of its bits
  --> tests/lint/shift_overflow/bad.jai:6:10
   |
 6 |     b := x >> 32;
   |          ^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: the shift count must be below 32; widen the value first, `(cast(u64) x) << 32`, if more bits are needed
   = note: `shift_overflow` is `warn` by default

